      "body": [
        {
          "component": "rich_text",
          "content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Imagine a gathering where inspiring and passionate women from all around the world, come together to generate global action to close the gender gap in health leadership. Well, that is exactly what happened at the Women Lift Health Conference in Tanzania. It was a transformative event that hosted an array of professional women in leadership. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Attending the conference was an exhilarating journey that left me profoundly inspired and empowered. When I stepped into the venue, I was captivated by the well-organized setup. Every aspect of the conference from the welcoming atmosphere to the thought provoking discussions, created an unforgettable experience. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "My key highlight was the opportunity to connect with remarkable women from across East Africa. Engaging with them not only expanded my professional circle but also enriched my perspective on women's health issues in the region. Stories of resilience and triumph from women who have faced adversity, particularly from countries like South Sudan, were truly eye-opening and humbling. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Moreover, the conference provided a platform for me to forge friendships with fellow medical students from different countries. Our shared passion for healthcare and learning bonded us instantly, and I am grateful for the lasting connections we formed. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The wealth of knowledge and insights gained was invaluable. Discussions ranged from leadership and data security, to insights on artificial intelligence and strategies for overcoming imposter syndrome. Each session broadened my understanding and equipped me with practical tools for personal and professional growth. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Embarking on this journey beyond Kenyan borders for the first time,, I was immersed in a new culture and environment. This experience expanded my horizons, providing invaluable exposure. It was a transformative adventure that has left an indelible mark on my journey. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "This conference was a celebration of female empowerment and I am grateful for the opportunity to have attended. It has ignited a passion within me to continue advocating for women's health and empowerment and I am excited for the journey ahead and the opportunity it holds. "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
